{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: 主流框架MOC | 面试总览","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"LangChain Agent的工作原理与ReAct循环\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"主流框架\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> intermediate\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> high\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/主流框架\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/intermediate</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a> | <a data-href=\"面试总览\" href=\"面试总览\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">面试总览</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"LangChain Agent的工作原理与ReAct循环\" dir=\"auto\">LangChain Agent的工作原理与ReAct循环</h1>\n<h2 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">请详细解释LangChain中Agent的工作原理，特别是ReAct（Reasoning + Acting）循环的执行流程，以及AgentExecutor在其中扮演的角色。</p>\n<h4 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h4>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct循环的核心机制</strong></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">ReAct框架通过\"思考→行动→观察\"的循环，让LLM能够系统性地解决复杂问题。其核心思想是将推理（Reasoning）和行动（Acting）结合，让模型在解决问题时交替进行思考和行动。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>ReAct循环执行流程：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">1. Observe（观察）：当前状态（用户问题+历史工具结果）格式化为Prompt\n2. Reason（推理）：LLM生成响应，可能包含工具调用\n3. Act（行动）：如果存在工具调用，AgentExecutor执行工具并将结果追加到Scratchpad\n4. Repeat（重复）：循环继续，直到LLM不再调用工具（输出Final Answer）\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>AgentExecutor的职责：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>循环管理</td>\n<td>控制ReAct循环的迭代执行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全防护</td>\n<td><code class=\"code-styler-inline\">max_iterations</code>防止无限循环，<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">handle_parsing_errors</code>处理解析错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间状态</td>\n<td>维护<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">intermediate_steps</code>记录每轮Thought/Action/Observation</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工具调度</td>\n<td>根据LLM决策调用对应工具并传递参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>错误恢复</td>\n<td>处理工具执行异常，支持降级策略</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>代码示例：ReAct Agent完整实现</strong></p>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_openai <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> ChatOpenAI\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tools <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> tool\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>agents <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> create_react_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> AgentExecutor\n<span class=\"token keyword\">from</span> langchain_core<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>prompts <span class=\"token keyword\">import</span> PromptTemplate\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 定义工具</span>\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@tool</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">search</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"搜索互联网获取信息\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"搜索结果: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>query<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span>\n\n<span class=\"token decorator annotation punctuation\">@tool</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">calculator</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>expression<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"计算数学表达式\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token builtin\">eval</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>expression<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\ntools <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span>search<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> calculator<span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建LLM</span>\nllm <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ChatOpenAI<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>model<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token string\">\"gpt-4\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> temperature<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">0</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># ReAct Prompt模板（简化版）</span>\nreact_template <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"Answer the following questions as best you can.\nYou have access to the following tools:\n{tools}\n\nUse the following format:\nQuestion: the input question you must answer\nThought: you should always think about what to do\nAction: the action to take, should be one of [{tool_names}]\nAction Input: the input to the action\nObservation: the result of the action\n... (this Thought/Action/Action Input/Observation can repeat N times)\nThought: I now know the final answer\nFinal Answer: the final answer to the original input question\n\nBegin!\n\nQuestion: {input}\n{agent_scratchpad}\"\"\"</span>\n\nprompt <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> PromptTemplate<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>from_template<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>react_template<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 创建Agent和Executor</span>\nagent <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> create_react_agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>llm<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> prompt<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\nexecutor <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> AgentExecutor<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>\n    agent<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>agent<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    tools<span class=\"token operator\">=</span>tools<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    verbose<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    max_iterations<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token number\">10</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    handle_parsing_errors<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    return_intermediate_steps<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token boolean\">True</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 执行</span>\nresult <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> executor<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>invoke<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token string\">\"input\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"特斯拉股价乘以100能买多少股?\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>result<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"output\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 查看中间步骤</span>\n<span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> step <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> result<span class=\"token punctuation\">[</span><span class=\"token string\">\"intermediate_steps\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">]</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    action<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> observation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> step\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Tool: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">, Input: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>action<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>tool_input<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">print</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token string-interpolation\"><span class=\"token string\">f\"Result: </span><span class=\"token interpolation\"><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>observation<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></span><span class=\"token string\">\"</span></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>执行过程可视化：</strong></p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">&gt; Entering new AgentExecutor chain...\nThought: 用户想查询特斯拉股价并进行计算，我需要先搜索股价\nAction: search\nAction Input: 特斯拉当前股价\nObservation: 特斯拉(TSLA)当前股价为250.75美元\nThought: 现在我知道股价是250.75美元，需要计算100美元能买多少股\nAction: calculator\nAction Input: 100 / 250.75\nObservation: 0.3988035892323031\nThought: 我现在知道100美元可以买大约0.399股\nFinal Answer: 100美元可以购买大约0.399股特斯拉股票。\n&gt; Finished chain.\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<h4 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问1</strong>：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">bind_tools</code>和<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">AgentExecutor</code>的本质区别是什么？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">bind_tools</code>是半自动模式，只调一次工具，工具结果不会自动喂回LLM；<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">AgentExecutor</code>是全自动推理循环，工具结果自动反馈给LLM继续推理，直到给出Final Answer。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>追问2</strong>：如何避免Agent陷入无限循环？\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\">答：设置<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">max_iterations</code>上限（如10-20次）；设置超时机制；在Prompt中引导LLM在无法继续时尽早终止；使用<code class=\"code-styler-inline\">early_stopping_method</code>参数。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h4>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：认为Agent可以处理任意复杂度的任务。</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：Agent的能力受限于LLM的推理能力、工具质量和上下文窗口大小。对于特别复杂的任务，需要考虑拆分为多Agent协作或使用Plan-and-Execute模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关知识点\" dir=\"auto\">相关知识点</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/00-Meta/MOCs/%E4%B8%BB%E6%B5%81%E6%A1%86%E6%9E%B6MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">主流框架MOC</a></li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}